WEBVTT

00:01.687 --> 00:04.317
My name is Subaru Natsuki!

00:04.687 --> 00:07.657
I'm Emilia-tan's number one knight!

00:09.537 --> 00:15.537
Don't you think you're letting 
your guard down a bit too much?!

00:16.537 --> 00:19.487
I don't let my guard down!

00:24.507 --> 00:25.967
Damn it! He got aw—

00:25.967 --> 00:26.877
Subaru!

00:26.877 --> 00:28.447
Whoa, whoa!

00:28.447 --> 00:30.507
Emilia-tan!

00:30.507 --> 00:34.267
Your hair's so soft, and it smells 
so nice! Are you using a new shampoo?

00:34.267 --> 00:37.147
Subaru, you jerk! You absolute jerk!

00:37.147 --> 00:40.717
I was so, so worried about 
you, you jerk! Jerk! Jerk!

00:40.717 --> 00:43.197
That's a lot of "jerk"s...

00:43.197 --> 00:45.627
I mean, I have no excuses, but...

00:49.857 --> 00:52.037
Are you back together now?

00:52.037 --> 00:52.617
Yeah.

00:53.117 --> 00:56.077
You were still Subaru even when 
you didn't have your memories.

00:56.077 --> 00:59.057
It wasn't for very long,
but you tried so hard to...

00:59.057 --> 01:00.837
I know. It's okay.

01:01.307 --> 01:06.077
That Subaru is still here, 
inside both you and me.

01:06.077 --> 01:09.397
So everything's really okay, Emilia-tan.

01:09.397 --> 01:10.257
Yeah.

01:21.197 --> 01:22.477
Found you.

01:24.387 --> 01:27.987
First things first, let's go 
fetch my adorable partner.

02:58.407 --> 02:59.427
Beako!

02:59.427 --> 03:00.667
Beatrice!

03:01.357 --> 03:06.117
S-Subaru and some woman 
I don't know are here!

03:06.557 --> 03:10.267
Oh, Beako! You're so light! And so cute!

03:10.267 --> 03:14.007
Look, Beatrice! Subaru 
remembers everything now!

03:11.127 --> 03:14.757
There you go! Upsy-daisy! Upsy-daisy!

03:14.007 --> 03:17.717
Wait, I suppose! Wait, I said!

03:17.717 --> 03:21.417
Subaru, do you really remember 
everything, I suppose?

03:21.417 --> 03:25.787
Including Betty, and the 
way we lived? Everything?

03:25.787 --> 03:30.177
Yeah, that's right.
So don't look so worried.

03:30.177 --> 03:31.387
Besides...

03:34.117 --> 03:36.517
Uh... older sister?

03:37.897 --> 03:40.727
The snow sure melted quickly, didn't it?

03:40.727 --> 03:43.027
Just the kind of big fuss over 
nothing I'd expect from you, Barusu.

03:43.677 --> 03:45.787
It's my long-awaited return!

03:45.787 --> 03:50.297
Meet Subaru Natsuki, the man of spring 
who comes when the snow mel—

03:51.107 --> 03:51.827
Ow...

03:52.917 --> 03:56.827
Looks like Patrasche is very 
happy to see you back, too.

03:56.827 --> 04:00.297
Feels like it's been forever since I 
got a tsundere reception like that.

04:00.297 --> 04:03.797
No. I'm sorry I worried you, too.

04:05.827 --> 04:09.277
But I should save the 
sentimentality for later.

04:09.277 --> 04:11.027
Let's finish all this up quick.

04:11.027 --> 04:13.527
There's something I want to ask first.

04:14.297 --> 04:16.017
Oh, me?

04:16.017 --> 04:19.717
Right! I'm Emilia. Just Emilia.

04:19.717 --> 04:21.437
There are lots of things I'd like to say,

04:21.437 --> 04:26.197
but we're family—you, me, and Beatrice—
and we're heading toward the same goal.

04:27.187 --> 04:30.297
What? Did I say something strange?

04:30.697 --> 04:34.077
There are many things I'd like 
to verify, but no matter.

04:34.077 --> 04:35.707
Gluttony is behind this, right?

04:35.707 --> 04:37.667
I don't like simply accepting defeat.

04:38.267 --> 04:42.617
I agree. We'll get them back for sure!

04:42.617 --> 04:46.377
Indeed! We'll repay them a 
hundred millionfold, I suppose!

04:47.117 --> 04:49.717
Now I really feel like I'm back home!

04:51.037 --> 04:53.557
So that's what's going
on in the tower now.

04:53.987 --> 04:57.217
In other words, the specific 
obstacles in front of us are...

04:57.217 --> 04:58.857
The two Gluttonies...

04:58.857 --> 05:02.067
...the mabeasts attacking 
from outside, and...

05:02.067 --> 05:05.317
...Shaula's attack. Four obstacles.

05:05.317 --> 05:06.487
Right.

05:08.327 --> 05:11.707
<i>So that must have shown up for the 
same reason it did at the Sanctuary—</i>

05:11.707 --> 05:14.817
<i>because Rui was here, and she 
knows about Return by Death.</i>

05:14.817 --> 05:19.077
<i>Now that she's gone,
it shouldn't come back... I think.</i>

05:19.077 --> 05:20.517
Subaru?

05:20.517 --> 05:21.957
Oh, sorry.

05:21.957 --> 05:25.247
Are you all right? Do you feel like 
you're being pulled hither and thither?

05:25.247 --> 05:27.967
There's another expression I 
haven't heard in a while...

05:29.257 --> 05:31.217
Subaru! Say that again!

05:31.527 --> 05:33.427
Later, okay? I'll say it later.

05:35.777 --> 05:38.407
Anyway, those are
the four obstacles we face.

05:38.407 --> 05:42.137
We're all gonna tackle them 
together. It's all-out war.

05:42.137 --> 05:44.357
And for that... Ram.

05:54.697 --> 05:55.507
Shaula?!

05:55.917 --> 06:00.187
Someone... Someone's broken a rule...

06:01.207 --> 06:03.817
This is bad.
She can't hold out any longer.

06:04.447 --> 06:06.237
Meili, how are you faring?

06:06.237 --> 06:09.047
Got my hands full, as you can see!

06:10.117 --> 06:11.897
Shaula!

06:16.837 --> 06:18.267
Master?

06:21.957 --> 06:24.427
Master, please... Give me...

06:24.427 --> 06:27.887
Give me the order!

06:31.477 --> 06:34.197
If you don't... I'll...

06:35.607 --> 06:37.017
Master!

06:38.387 --> 06:44.037
I keep telling you, there's no reason 
for you to call me your master.

06:47.267 --> 06:50.487
I won't tell you to kill yourself.

06:50.487 --> 06:54.517
I won't let you end your 400 
years of waiting in tears!

06:55.937 --> 06:59.027
Master... I love you!

07:16.277 --> 07:18.247
Meili! Echidna!

07:18.247 --> 07:20.037
Natsuki?! You're back to—

07:20.037 --> 07:20.507
No...

07:21.047 --> 07:22.367
You got your memories back?!

07:22.367 --> 07:25.557
You catch on fast. How'd you know?

07:25.557 --> 07:27.957
I can tell from the look on Beatrice's face.

07:28.897 --> 07:30.087
Who is...

07:30.087 --> 07:33.247
It's Gluttony's doing. Same as Julius.

07:33.247 --> 07:34.767
Her name is Emilia.

07:37.787 --> 07:40.827
Echidna, you join up with Julius.

07:40.827 --> 07:44.007
I've talked to Emilia about 
what to do from there.

07:44.007 --> 07:45.617
What will you two do?

07:45.617 --> 07:50.537
Subaru and Betty will play with 
this giant scorpion, I suppose.

07:50.857 --> 07:55.047
I'm not going to doubt 
your plans now. I'll obey.

07:55.047 --> 07:56.407
Any messages for Julius?

07:56.407 --> 07:58.457
No, not particularly.

07:58.457 --> 08:01.007
He's Julius Juukulius, you know.

08:02.467 --> 08:04.957
Oh, actually, I do have a message!

08:04.957 --> 08:06.967
"Everyone else is having a hard time,

08:06.967 --> 08:10.247
so hurry up and finish your 
job so you can help them."

08:10.247 --> 08:13.527
Got it. I'll pass that along word for word.

08:15.887 --> 08:18.887
Just like we discussed.
You're the key here, Emilia-tan.

08:18.887 --> 08:21.007
Right. Leave it to me.

08:21.007 --> 08:22.887
And don't you go dying 
or anything, all right?

08:23.207 --> 08:24.597
Of course.

08:26.437 --> 08:29.697
And? What am I supposed to do?

08:29.697 --> 08:32.147
Sorry, but you'll be helping us, Meili.

08:32.517 --> 08:38.627
You, me, and Beako will put down the 
mabeast stampede and the big scorpion.

08:39.767 --> 08:40.697
Incoming!

08:44.887 --> 08:46.617
Grab on!

08:54.797 --> 08:57.687
Whoa, whoa, whoa, I suppose!

08:58.607 --> 09:03.627
I never thought you and I would 
be fighting side by side!

09:08.887 --> 09:10.067
Dodge!

09:10.867 --> 09:13.537
Whoa, whoa, whoa, I say!

09:19.897 --> 09:21.807
I don't even feel alive...

09:21.807 --> 09:24.017
That was like a nightmare!

09:24.017 --> 09:26.467
Oh, that's just getting started.

09:29.667 --> 09:35.327
Let's do this! We're gonna destroy fate—or 
rather, the tower's whole system!

09:38.327 --> 09:42.147
You really think you can 
beat me like that, bro?!

09:48.747 --> 09:49.927
That's enough.

09:59.897 --> 10:02.587
What the hell? You're hot!

10:02.587 --> 10:06.657
Hot as hell! I'd rather be up against you!

10:07.057 --> 10:09.067
I'm sorry for interrupting,

10:09.067 --> 10:12.417
but we need Julius to defeat you.

10:12.417 --> 10:14.387
Say what?

10:14.387 --> 10:16.647
I know you just saved me, but...

10:16.647 --> 10:19.847
Echidna, who is this woman?

10:19.847 --> 10:24.807
According to Natsuki, she's someone 
in the same position as you.

10:24.807 --> 10:25.507
What?

10:26.027 --> 10:30.977
Yes, Julius. I now know 
all too well how you feel.

10:31.287 --> 10:33.707
Then it's true...

10:33.707 --> 10:37.287
Hey, c'mon. What's your deal, hot stuff?

10:37.287 --> 10:40.527
For some reason, my hand just doesn't 
wanna reach out to stop you.

10:40.527 --> 10:41.317
Don't tell me...

10:41.697 --> 10:44.367
you've already cleared the exam?!

10:44.367 --> 10:48.327
Yes, that's right. You touched my 
chest with your chopsticks and lost.

10:48.327 --> 10:52.147
Hah! Couldn't have asked 
for a more fun way to lose!

10:52.147 --> 10:54.797
It's a damn shame I don't remember it!

10:54.797 --> 10:56.917
Julius, I...

10:56.917 --> 11:02.647
Go on, beautiful one whose name 
is unknown just like mine.

11:02.647 --> 11:04.007
I wish you the best.

11:05.097 --> 11:06.967
Right. Same to you.

11:13.597 --> 11:18.227
Are you going to stay here 
and observe my battle?

11:18.227 --> 11:21.817
If you'll allow it...

11:21.817 --> 11:24.007
No, that's not right.

11:24.007 --> 11:28.127
I determined for myself that 
that's what I ought to do.

11:28.127 --> 11:29.217
After all...

11:30.067 --> 11:33.707
After all, you are Anastasia Hoshin's knight.

11:33.997 --> 11:35.067
Aren't you?

11:36.847 --> 11:39.847
That gives me even more 
strength than I expected.

11:39.847 --> 11:42.247
Someone who doesn't even know who I am

11:42.247 --> 11:45.547
trusts me and places their hopes in me,

11:45.547 --> 11:47.677
a man who may well be no one at all.

11:48.067 --> 11:50.787
Julius, I have a message for you.

11:51.597 --> 11:56.147
"Hurry up and finish your job 
so you can help the others."

11:57.657 --> 12:02.187
If he's broken out of his 
shell, I mustn't fall behind.

12:05.817 --> 12:07.627
I'm Reid the stick swinger.

12:07.927 --> 12:10.967
Go ahead and fall, but remember that name.

12:12.327 --> 12:14.327
Allow me to give you my name again.

12:14.327 --> 12:19.587
I am Julius Juukulius, Lady Anastasia 
Hoshin's number one knight.

12:20.297 --> 12:24.357
My time playing some 
nameless knight ends now.

12:28.477 --> 12:32.977
We can't get in touch with 
cute little Rui or even Roy.

12:32.977 --> 12:35.187
Well, no helping that!

12:35.187 --> 12:39.987
If they can't do it, we'll have to 
slurp up this whole meal ourselves!

12:39.987 --> 12:41.287
How carefree of you.

12:42.447 --> 12:45.577
And you really think you 
have the right to do that?

12:46.387 --> 12:51.287
I've heard that you're the one who tore the 
sisterly love between me and Rem asunder.

12:54.317 --> 12:56.837
I'll make you squeal like a pig as you die.

12:56.837 --> 13:00.127
What's wrong? You think this is a game?

13:00.127 --> 13:03.217
Do ya? Do ya? Do ya?!

13:05.267 --> 13:07.887
As your mood changes, so does your sword.

13:08.227 --> 13:12.857
I've been expectin' that 
explosion from you, and yet...

13:12.857 --> 13:16.567
You gonna be so fixated 
on manners that you lose?

13:16.567 --> 13:19.477
And you're satisfied with that, bro?

13:19.477 --> 13:21.927
All criticisms I feel I've heard before,

13:21.927 --> 13:23.787
but you truly don't hold back, do you?

13:23.787 --> 13:28.987
Figures. Ain't nothin' to your 
sword work but desperation!

13:31.287 --> 13:34.547
You're puttin' in this whole 
polite, proper knight act,

13:34.547 --> 13:38.007
but on the inside, you're 
just a stick swinger like me.

13:38.407 --> 13:42.217
Just watchin' you feels suffocating. 
I can't bear to see it, bro.

13:44.537 --> 13:45.897
I see...

13:47.057 --> 13:49.057
I think I finally understand now.

13:49.417 --> 13:50.357
Eh?

13:50.987 --> 13:54.687
Why you are so relentless with me.

13:54.687 --> 13:58.337
You see something in me 
that reminds you of yourself.

13:58.337 --> 14:00.867
I dunno any of that complicated shit.

14:00.867 --> 14:03.667
I just know what my instincts tell me:

14:03.667 --> 14:07.847
that you'd be a lot more interesting 
if you'd drop the mask!

14:07.847 --> 14:09.927
I know you know it, too!

14:09.927 --> 14:12.577
You're never gonna beat me as you are now,

14:12.577 --> 14:16.667
and you're never gonna impress 
that hottie behind you!

14:18.877 --> 14:20.507
You are right.

14:20.787 --> 14:24.467
That is exactly why I will 
never stop being who I am!

14:26.507 --> 14:29.277
What you say is surely accurate.

14:29.277 --> 14:31.227
Many of your statements ring true.

14:31.957 --> 14:35.247
I am not a legitimate child 
of the Juukulius family.

14:35.887 --> 14:38.517
I was born to commoners.

14:38.517 --> 14:40.707
Before my current father took me in,

14:40.707 --> 14:43.317
I had no knowledge of noble culture.

14:43.317 --> 14:47.027
Who I am is something I 
built from the ground up.

14:47.027 --> 14:49.617
It's just an ugly-ass façade, though.

14:49.617 --> 14:51.507
Perhaps it is.

14:51.507 --> 14:56.337
The rustic boy who knew nothing 
of ideals may well be the true me.

14:57.017 --> 14:58.297
However...

14:58.947 --> 15:01.047
I met my ideal.

15:14.437 --> 15:19.747
That is why I will see my aspirations 
through and maintain the guise of a knight.

15:19.747 --> 15:23.347
I will cling to my pretensions 
and lock away my original self.

15:24.377 --> 15:27.727
I will stand with proper posture, 
straighten out my clothes,

15:27.727 --> 15:30.267
put on the appearance 
of the one I wish to be,

15:30.267 --> 15:32.867
and prop myself up on my 
determination to see it through.

15:32.867 --> 15:37.207
That is the façade that I've 
decided to wear for all eternity.

15:38.007 --> 15:40.637
There are, of course, those 
who mock such ostentation,

15:40.637 --> 15:46.627
but I believe there are just 
as many who find it dazzling,

15:47.267 --> 15:50.927
in the same way that I have long 
aspired to live as a knight.

15:58.437 --> 16:01.727
Allow me to apologize, my buds.

16:07.787 --> 16:10.467
I was afraid of change.

16:11.157 --> 16:16.867
But I now relinquish that 
weak, pathetic, cowardly self.

16:17.797 --> 16:21.297
My buds, I hereby set you free.

16:22.067 --> 16:25.527
Forgive me for clinging so 
long to our broken bond.

16:29.757 --> 16:33.717
Having said all that, I now 
call upon all of you once more!

16:34.607 --> 16:36.317
I love you all.

16:36.847 --> 16:41.437
If you can accept this vain pretender's 
advances, let us form a new bond!

16:42.047 --> 16:45.947
A new contract between me and all of you!

16:52.667 --> 16:53.687
Thank you.

16:54.367 --> 17:00.067
Although we may hurt each other, 
at times deeply, at times gently...

17:00.067 --> 17:01.997
I will continue to walk this path.

17:03.707 --> 17:08.117
You're a lot stronger now that 
you've broken outta your shell.

17:10.937 --> 17:13.217
I'm gonna make you cry!

17:20.247 --> 17:22.147
What're you laughin' about?

17:22.427 --> 17:25.727
Nothing. I was only thinking

17:25.727 --> 17:27.907
that when I return home from here,

17:27.907 --> 17:30.357
I should challenge my friend Reinhard.

17:31.507 --> 17:33.907
What'd you say your name was, bro?

17:34.797 --> 17:36.967
Julius Juukulius.

17:36.967 --> 17:40.617
It is quite a forgettable name, 
so I wish to remember it.

17:49.527 --> 17:51.387
Al Cranvel!

17:54.007 --> 17:54.927
Now...

17:55.327 --> 17:56.887
Sure, whatever.

17:57.277 --> 17:58.207
Here I come!

18:12.977 --> 18:13.767
Ia!

18:18.247 --> 18:19.167
Iku!

18:29.577 --> 18:31.367
Kua! Ia!

18:37.257 --> 18:38.787
Ia! Aro!

18:51.487 --> 18:54.957
Al Clarista!

19:10.297 --> 19:14.357
<i>I was born into this world with no objective.</i>

19:15.177 --> 19:18.247
<i>I had no idea why I was born.</i>

19:19.417 --> 19:20.137
<i>But...</i>

19:24.907 --> 19:27.257
Do you remember, Ana?

19:28.267 --> 19:31.227
This is where I met you.

19:32.567 --> 19:36.007
You boasted that you were greedy

19:36.007 --> 19:38.857
and wanted to get
your hands on everything.

19:39.557 --> 19:43.307
That's why you're staying here 
and won't come out, right?

19:44.977 --> 19:47.127
While you hide within your od,

19:47.447 --> 19:50.337
the world outside cannot reach you.

19:50.847 --> 19:55.057
If you leave it, you will be 
affected by Gluttony's authority—

19:55.057 --> 19:59.997
in other words, you will 
forget Julius Juukulius.

20:01.057 --> 20:03.847
And that scares you.

20:04.417 --> 20:06.647
To the girl who wanted everything,

20:06.647 --> 20:09.017
nothing is as scary as losing something.

20:09.827 --> 20:13.327
But are you sure that's what you want?

20:19.007 --> 20:23.197
You want to miss out on seeing 
your knight at his most gallant?

20:23.197 --> 20:25.157
A stingy one like you

20:25.807 --> 20:28.417
could never let such an 
opportunity go to waste.

20:51.307 --> 20:52.067
Julius!

20:52.817 --> 20:55.527
Get 'im, my knight!

21:18.797 --> 21:24.337
Well, what a boring ending 
this turned out to be.

21:31.557 --> 21:34.187
I guess in the end,

21:34.187 --> 21:39.397
a man like me just couldn't 
fit into another vessel.

21:42.727 --> 21:47.247
Roy Alphard's body couldn't withstand you?

21:47.247 --> 21:49.857
Don't get the wrong idea, bro.

21:50.417 --> 21:52.277
If I was in my own body,

21:52.277 --> 21:54.957
you wouldn't even be gettin' close 
enough to wipe your snot on me.

21:54.957 --> 21:57.287
I wouldn't do that anyway.

21:57.287 --> 21:59.807
Hah! You're no fun.

22:02.897 --> 22:06.637
I have only the most heartfelt 
respect for your power.

22:07.017 --> 22:10.257
I don't need some
dumb boy lookin' up to me.

22:10.787 --> 22:13.437
I won, Julius.

22:17.937 --> 22:23.407
Yes. Until the very end, you 
are the winner, Reid Astrea.

22:23.407 --> 22:24.657
Hah!

22:25.267 --> 22:27.637
I like that look on your face...

22:31.647 --> 22:33.547
you loser.

22:31.837 --> 22:36.087
<b>Good Loser</b>

22:52.457 --> 22:54.357
It is a pleasure to meet you.

22:54.357 --> 22:55.357
I'm...

22:55.907 --> 22:58.427
I'm Anastasia Hoshin.

22:58.427 --> 23:00.857
I want everything in this world.

23:01.577 --> 23:04.347
Well, you incredibly good-lookin' man,

23:04.347 --> 23:05.727
what's your name?

23:05.727 --> 23:06.407
Of course.

23:09.417 --> 23:11.997
I am Julius Juukulius,

23:12.327 --> 23:14.037
your number one knight.

23:14.947 --> 23:16.797
You may not remember,

23:16.797 --> 23:19.957
but I dedicated my sword to you.

23:20.937 --> 23:27.277
I am here to give all my strength 
to you and support your ambition.

23:27.277 --> 23:28.627
That so?

23:28.627 --> 23:32.137
I don't really remember
any of that, but...

23:32.927 --> 23:34.847
I only needed one look at you

23:35.637 --> 23:39.317
to know that I needed to make you mine.

23:47.347 --> 23:48.187
I'm out!

23:48.807 --> 23:49.617
Huh?

23:50.117 --> 23:53.437
The first floor is... outside?

23:54.577 --> 23:57.077
It's even higher up than the clouds.

24:06.857 --> 24:07.987
You're...

24:09.637 --> 24:13.647
Thou who hath reached the tower's summit,

24:14.387 --> 24:18.307
petitioner of omnipotence who hath 
set foot upon the first floor...

24:19.857 --> 24:22.247
I am Volcanica.

24:22.247 --> 24:24.637
Per the ancient covenant,

24:24.637 --> 24:28.737
I ask the will of the one 
who hath reached the summit.
